- **WebSocket Channels**: Booking status; tour updates; weather alerts; emergency notifications.
- **Push Notifications**: Booking confirmations; payment receipts; tour reminders; emergency alerts.
- **Event Sourcing**: Booking state changes; payment events; tour modifications; user actions.
- **Message Queuing**: Reliable delivery; retry logic; dead letter queues; monitoring.

