## Testing Strategies for Travel Domain

### Travel-Specific Test Scenarios
```gherkin
Feature: Multi-Currency Booking Flow
  Scenario: Tourist books tour with foreign currency
    Given I am browsing from Germany
    And my preferred currency is EUR
    When I book a tour priced in USD
    Then I should see converted prices in EUR
    And payment should process in EUR
    And operator should receive USD equivalent
    And exchange rate should be clearly disclosed

Feature: Offline Tour Participation
  Scenario: Active tour with network loss
    Given I have an active tour booking
    And I am at the tour meeting point
    When I lose internet connectivity
    Then I should still access tour details
    And GPS tracking should continue
    And emergency contacts should be available
    And location data should queue for sync
```

